WEBVTT - Charade (English Subtitles)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[A quiet winter ski resort in the French Alps]

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Regina Lampert sits by the lodge terrace overlooking the snowy valley.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Peter Joshua approaches with a warm, mysterious smile.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Peter: "Do you know that you are staring, Mrs. Lampert?"

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Regina: "I was merely wondering why you're wearing an overcoat in a heated lodge."

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Peter: "Occupational hazard. One never knows when a quick exit may be required."

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Regina: "Are you planning on robbing the hotel or just fleeing an admirer?"
